<title>SHARJAH: CRICKET-SRI LANKA BEAT ZIMBABWE IN SHARJAH CUP.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA BEAT ZIMBABWE IN SHARJAH CUP.</headline>
<dateline>SHARJAH, United Arab Emirates 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka beat Zimbabwe by seven wickets in the opening match of the Sharjah Cup cricket tournament on Thursday.</p>
<p>Scores: Zimbabwe 187-9 in 50 overs, Sri Lanka 188-3 in 45.4 overs.</p>
</text>
